The first add beside a plan seeds `defaults.md` with its H1, writes entry `D1` with the stubbed
heading time and a link to the artefact, and prints `{sidecar}#D1` alone.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  "core.macros.date +%Y-%m-%d %H:%M": "2026-10-15 16:40"
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/p/index.md --
---
title: P
---

# P
-- cmd --
booping defaults add --target plans/p/index.md --step develop/provision --asked "Confirm the branch name `feat/autonomy-modes`?" --default "`feat/autonomy-modes`, the proposed name" --why "core.autonomy is autonomous; the proposal follows the branch conventions"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
plans/p/defaults.md#D1
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/vault/plans/p/defaults.md --
# Defaults

## D1 — develop/provision — 2026-10-15 16:40

**Asked:** Confirm the branch name `feat/autonomy-modes`?

**Default:** `feat/autonomy-modes`, the proposed name

**Why:** core.autonomy is autonomous; the proposal follows the branch conventions

**Artifact:** [index.md](index.md)
